FoamFile { version 2.0; format ascii; class dictionary; object fvOptions; }
// The viscous-heating term itself.  This is OpenFOAM's OWN shipped fvOption
// (src/fvOptions/sources/derived/viscousDissipation), NOT lab-written code, and
// it builds its source from the NUMERICALLY SOLVED U via grad(U) -- never from
// the closed form.  With a basicThermo present it targets thermo.he() itself.
viscousHeating
{
    type            viscousDissipation;
    U               U;
}
